# Ruleset: Downloads
#
# Expects DIRECT.
#
# Netdisk fronts, OS and game content CDNs, and the update and object storage hosts that the 14 days to 2026-09-09 measured clean on the direct path: store.setapp.com 460 flows, Cloudflare R2 559, OrbStack updates 183, none failed. The Steam and Nintendo delivery hosts follow the same rule for game downloads without a measurement yet. Microsoft delivery lives in Platforms/MicrosoftCDN.list.
#
# The 1Password, iStat Menus and PopClip update hosts left this list: they completed direct but answered slowly, 0.5 to 1.5 s per request against 0.2 to 0.6 s through a Hong Kong exit (measured 2026-10-30), so they reach a proxy through FINAL.

